266 - Spirit of God
 / 
Key: Bb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 266
Topic: Holy Spirit - 

Verse 1:
[Bb]Spirit of [F7/A]God, [Bb]descend [Dm]upon [F7]my [Bb]heart;
[Gm]wean [A]it [A7/Db]from [Dm]earth; through [F/C]all its [Cm]pulses [F]move;
[F]stoop to my [F7]weakness, mighty as thou art,
[Bb]and [Cm]make [Bb/D]me [F7/Eb]love [Eb]thee [Bb/F]as [Gm]I [Bb/F]ought [F7]to [Bb]love.

Verse 2:
[Bb]I ask no [F7/A]dream, [Bb]no [Eb]prophet [Cm]ecstasies,
[Gm]no [A]sudden [Dm]rending [F/C]of the [Cm]veil of [F]clay,
[F]no angel visitant, [F7]no opening skies;
[Bb]but [Cm]take [Bb/D]the [F7/Eb]dimness [Bb/F]of [Gm]my [Bb/F]soul [F7]away.

Verse 3:
[Bb]Has thou not [F7/A]bid [Bb]me [Eb]love [Dm]thee, [Cm]God [F7]and [Bb]King?
[Gm]All, [A]all [A7/Db]thine [Dm]own, soul, [F/C]heart and [Cm]strength and [F]mind.
[F]I see thy [F7]cross; there teach my heart to cling.
[Bb]O [Cm]let [Bb/D]me [F7/Eb]seek [Eb]thee, [Bb/F]and [Gm]O [Bb/F]let [F7]me [Bb]find.

Verse 4:
[Bb]Teach me to [F7/A]feel [Bb]that [Eb]thou [Dm]art [Cm]always [Bb]nigh;
[Gm]teach [A]me [A7/Db]the [Dm]struggles [F/C]of the [Cm]soul to [F]bear.
[F]To check the [F7]rising doubt, the rebel sigh,
[Bb]teach [Cm]me [Bb/D]the [F7/Eb]patience [Bb/F]of [Gm]unanswered [Bb]prayer.

Verse 5:
[Bb]Teach me to [F7/A]love [Bb]thee [Eb]as [Dm]thine [Cm]angels [Bb]love,
[Gm]one [A]holy [Dm]passion [F/C]filling [Cm]all my [F]frame;
[F]the kindling of [F7]the heaven-descended Dove,
[Bb]my [Cm]heart [Bb/D]an [F7/Eb]altar, [Bb/F]and [Gm]thy [Bb/F]love [F7]the [Bb]flame.
